+    /// EDEN_UP_DJ_FRAG_BARRIER=1 (Djihads80/Eglantine c6d2acd37, Nx2Perf fragment_barrier, from
+    /// #161): the 3D engine's fragment barrier no longer ends the render pass at once. It is noted,
+    /// and the next draw ends the pass (whose end carries the barrier) only when it samples one of
+    /// the bound render targets or the pass has a draw that writes storage; otherwise the pass goes
+    /// on. Upstream: Ocarina of Time ended ~5,900 render passes a second at its fragment barriers.
+    [[nodiscard]] static bool DeferFragmentBarriers();
