+    /// A fragment barrier arrived: pending while a render pass is open (EDEN_UP_DJ_FRAG_BARRIER),
+    /// or a deferred clear waits to begin one: the end the barrier asked for realized that clear
+    /// before the next draw (review fix, not upstream; the end then still comes when that draw
